                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It is lovely little game with beautiful artwork and a relaxing atmosphere. You will meet cute animals living in different environments! My favourite is the autumn-themed map! At first, it looks pretty empty, with just a few trees and fallen leaves scattered around. But as you help the animals find what they need, they settle into the scene and stay there, slowly making the map feel more lively and complete. \n\nThe gameplay is pretty simple. You just help the animals find the things they are looking for on each map. Some objects are easy to spot, while others blend into the background and take a little more patience to find. There is a hint button if you get stuck, but one of the achievements requires you to play without using any hints, so you will have to find everything yourself if you are going for 100%. I managed to find everything without too much trouble. You can also double-click on the map to zoom in, which makes those tiny hidden objects a lot easier to spot.\n\nMy only complaint is that some of the maps are a little too bright for my eyes. I wish there was an option to adjust the colors or brightness, because some of the backgrounds is a bit hard to look at for too long. I have to take a break after finishing one or two maps because my eyes start to get tired. Other than that, it's a really cute and relaxing little game, especially if you love animals and nature!\n\n♡ If you're looking for more cozy, puzzle, point & click, and visual novel game recommendations, feel free to stop by my curator page: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/202643]10:07 am ☕︎ ⋆｡˚ ♡[/url]",
